<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 9.58 bln rupees at 1-yr auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 9.58 bln rupees at 1-yr auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Wednesday said it raised 9.58 billion rupees at a fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>The cut-off rate at the auction was 92.23 rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
